      "quote": "You can request deletion of your account and personal data at any time."
    },
    {
      "article_id": "kb-009",
      "quote": "Before deletion, active subscriptions must be cancelled; deleting the account does not cancel an App Store or Google Play subscription."
    },
    {
      "article_id": "kb-009",
      "quote": "Support agents do not delete data themselves. They confirm the request, verify the account owner and forward the case to the Privacy team."
    }
  ],
